---
// Icons: DiagramIcon from diagram-icons.ts. Motion: fig-motion.css classes (fm-*).
// Median time and memory per call for Sum1..Sum6. Values are copied from the benchstat tables in the post
// (Apple M2, Go 1.27.1, 1,000,000 lines, -cpu 1, -count 10).
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900;
const x0 = 270;
const sc = 7; // px per ms
const top = 66;
const rowH = 38;
const rows = [
  { n: 'Sum1', icon: 'slow', en: 'bytes.Split', vi: 'bytes.Split', ms: 52.07, t: '52.07 ms', mem: '29.9 MiB', bad: false },
  { n: 'Sum2', icon: 'search', en: 'scan in place', vi: 'quét tại chỗ', ms: 23.55, t: '23.55 ms', mem: '7.0 MiB', bad: false },
  { n: 'Sum3', icon: 'doc', en: 'string without copy', vi: 'chuỗi không sao chép', ms: 21.02, t: '21.02 ms', mem: '7.0 MiB', bad: false },
  { n: 'Sum4', icon: 'code', en: 'own ParseInt', vi: 'ParseInt tự viết', ms: 14.36, t: '14.36 ms', mem: '7.0 MiB', bad: false },
  { n: 'Sum5', icon: 'warning', en: 'bufio.Scanner', vi: 'bufio.Scanner', ms: 20.69, t: '20.69 ms', mem: '4.2 KiB', bad: true },
  { n: 'Sum6', icon: 'fast', en: '8 KiB buffer', vi: 'buffer 8 KiB', ms: 13.99, t: '13.99 ms', mem: '8.2 KiB', bad: false },
];
const axisY = top + rows.length * rowH + 4;
const H = axisY + 56;
const X = (ms) => x0 + ms * sc;
---
<figure class="gp19b">
  <div class="gp19b-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Bars of the median time per call for Sum1 to Sum6, with memory per call at the right. Sum1 takes 52.07 ms and 29.9 MiB. Sum4 takes 14.36 ms. Sum5 is slower at 20.69 ms. Sum6 takes 13.99 ms and 8.2 KiB.">
    <text x="20" y="24" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Six versions of Sum, one file of 1,000,000 lines</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Sáu phiên bản của Sum, cùng một file 1.000.000 dòng</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={x0} y={top - 14} class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Time per call, median</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Thời gian mỗi lần gọi, trung vị</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="740" y={top - 14} class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Memory per call</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Bộ nhớ mỗi lần gọi</tspan>
    </text>
    {rows.map((r, i) => {
      const y = top + i * rowH;
      return (
        <g>
          <DiagramIcon name={r.icon} x={32} y={y + 16} size={26} />
          <text x="54" y={y + 22} class="b">{r.n}</text>
          <text x="108" y={y + 22} class="m">
            <tspan data-lang-en>{r.en}</tspan>
            <tspan data-lang-vi>{r.vi}</tspan>
          </text>
          <rect x={x0} y={y + 6} width={r.ms * sc} height="20" rx="3" class={r.bad ? 'bar bad fm-pulse' : 'bar'} />
          <text x={X(r.ms) + 8} y={y + 22} class={r.bad ? 'r num' : 'b num'}>{r.t}</text>
          <text x="740" y={y + 22} class="b num">{r.mem}</text>
        </g>
      );
    })}
    <line x1={x0} x2={X(60)} y1={axisY} y2={axisY} class="axis" />
    {[0, 20, 40, 60].map((ms) => (
      <g>
        <line x1={X(ms)} x2={X(ms)} y1={axisY} y2={axisY + 6} class={ms === 20 ? 'goal' : 'axis'} />
        <text x={X(ms)} y={axisY + 22} text-anchor="middle" class={ms === 20 ? 'b num' : 'm num'}>{ms}</text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <text x={X(60) + 8} y={axisY + 22} class="m">ms</text>
    <text x={X(20)} y={axisY + 44} text-anchor="middle" class="goalt">
      <tspan data-lang-en>goal: 20 ms (20 ns per line)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>mục tiêu: 20 ms (20 ns mỗi dòng)</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Sum5 (<code>bufio.Scanner</code>) is the only step that gets slower; it is the price of its 4.2 KiB of memory. Sum6 keeps Sum4's speed and cuts memory from 7.0 MiB to 8.2 KiB.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Sum5 (<code>bufio.Scanner</code>) là bước duy nhất chậm đi; đó là cái giá của 4,2 KiB bộ nhớ. Sum6 giữ tốc độ của Sum4 mà đưa bộ nhớ từ 7,0 MiB xuống 8,2 KiB.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp19b { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp19b-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp19b svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 720px; height: auto; }
  .gp19b text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp19b .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp19b .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp19b .m { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp19b .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .gp19b .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gp19b .bar { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp19b .bar.bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .gp19b .axis { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp19b .goal { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 3; }
  .gp19b .goalt { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp19b figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
